READING: reachable source classes (the TRUE LRC win-set) are far fewer
than A000568(n-1); for n<=4 they are forced transitive (arc <= 1/2). The
min-near-runner histogram shows how close any set comes to source-
avoidance (a 0 bucket = an open lonely interval; all sets reach 0 or a
boundary source => LRC verified on the tournament side).
